00:19:07,120 --> 00:19:08,940
的确  但后来呢
There was... but eventually,

537
00:19:08,940 --> 00:19:10,680
她还是帮爱尔兰佬修车了
she started fixing Irish people's cars.

538
00:19:12,660 --> 00:19:15,160
莉莉  你去把剩下的转紧吧
Well, uh, Lily, why don't you finish it off.

539
00:19:18,900 --> 00:19:20,380
我不够力气
I'm not strong enough.

540
00:19:20,620 --> 00:19:21,880
我来帮你
Well, then let me help you.

541
00:19:22,440 --> 00:19:23,400
我们联手力气更大
We're stronger together.

542
00:19:25,740 --> 00:19:28,060
我们联合的确更强大
Wow. We are stronger together.

543
00:19:28,920 --> 00:19:30,520
对不起我之前看轻你
Oh, I'm sorry I put you down before.

544
00:19:30,680 --> 00:19:32,320
你是个很强大的女人  歌洛莉亚
You are a formidable woman, Gloria.

545
00:19:32,720 --> 00:19:33,640
你值得受人尊敬
You deserve respect.

546
00:19:33,780 --> 00:19:35,560
不  克莱尔  你才值得受人敬重
No, Claire, you are the one that deserves respect.

547
00:19:36,200 --> 00:19:39,600
你养大了三个很棒的孩子  经营了一家公司
You have raised three wonderful children, you run a company,

548
00:19:39,780 --> 00:19:42,080
不浪费时间在鸡毛蒜皮的小事
you don't waste time on silly things like...

549
00:19:42,080 --> 00:19:43,760
比如搞发型之类的
the way your hair looks.

550
00:19:44,080 --> 00:19:45,320
你会把该做的事都做好
You just get things done.

551
00:19:45,680 --> 00:19:48,201
这样就好了  你们能重新上路了
And that is it. You guys are all set.

552
00:19:48,340 --> 00:19:49,240
真的很谢谢你
Thank you so much.

553
00:19:49,240 --> 00:19:50,800
有什么方法可以报答你吗
Is there any way we could pay you for your time?

554
00:19:50,800 --> 00:19:52,500
不用不用  真的不必
No, no, absolutely not.

555
00:19:52,680 --> 00:19:53,640
我很乐意帮忙
I'm happy to help.

556
00:19:53,760 --> 00:19:55,480
让我帮忙你们重置胎压检测系统
But let me just reset your tire-pressure monitor

557
00:19:55,480 --> 00:19:56,720
这样它才不会一直发出警示音
so that thing doesn't beep at you all day.

558
00:19:57,000 --> 00:19:58,140
好的  去吧  劳烦你了
Yes, please. Go right ahead.

559
00:19:58,280 --> 00:19:58,780
看到了吗  莉莉
See that, Lily?

560
00:19:58,900 --> 00:20:00,480
我们不需要男人来解救我们
We didn't need a man to help us get out of this.

561
00:20:00,580 --> 00:20:02,720
当女人对别的女人伸出援手时就是这样
This is what happens when women help other women.

562
00:20:09,380 --> 00:20:11,720
她应该只是确定一下有没有修好吧
She's probably just making sure it works, right?

563
00:20:12,680 --> 00:20:14,380
那个贱人偷走了我的车
So that bitch stole my car.

564
00:20:14,820 --> 00:20:17,180
往好的方面看  看到一名女性打入
On a positive note, it is nice to see a woman

565
00:20:17,180 --> 00:20:19,640
曾是男性主导的行业领域也很棒
break into a previously male-dominated field.

566
00:20:19,640 --> 00:20:21,940
我的化妆品不在保险里
My makeup was not insured.

567
00:20:26,140 --> 00:20:27,580
这是完美解决方法啊
It's the perfect solution.

568
00:20:27,944 --> 00:20:28,821
我们不能就做个决定就行了吗
Can't we just make an decision?

569
00:20:29,160 --> 00:20:29,840
怎么了
What's going on?

570
00:20:30,100 --> 00:20:31,840
你爸跟我在争一件事
Oh, your father and I have been arguing about something

571
00:20:31,840 --> 00:20:32,460
争了一个多小时了
for over an hour.

572
00:20:32,680 --> 00:20:34,200
幸好  我做了个特别的硬币
Fortunately, I've made a special coin

573
00:20:34,221 --> 00:20:36,941
一面是我的脸  一面是你妈的脸
with my face on one side and your mom's on the other.

574
00:20:37,140 --> 00:20:38,026
像女权斗士纪念币的丑版
Ugh, Susan B. Unflattering.

575
00:20:38,620 --> 00:20:39,700
好的  来吧
Okay, here we go.

576
00:20:41,440 --> 00:20:42,481
-是克莱尔那面  -赞
- It came up Claire. - Yep!

577
00:20:43,180 --> 00:20:44,280
以后火葬
Getting cremated!

578
00:20:44,400 --> 00:20:44,900
靠
Damn it!

579
00:20:45,280 --> 00:20:46,080
好的  还有一题
Okay, here's another one...

580
00:20:46,600 --> 00:20:49,440
我那面  我们用储备金买海边公寓
my head, we use our nest egg for a beach condo.

581
00:20:49,820 --> 00:20:51,700
你那面  就留给孩子当应急金
Yours, the kids' safety net.

582
00:20:51,840 --> 00:20:52,940
干嘛这样
Hey, not cool.

583
00:20:55,300 --> 00:20:56,560
抱歉啦  孩子们
I'm so sorry, you guys.

584
00:20:56,947 --> 00:20:57,781
你们还是可以来探望我们啊
Aw, you can come visit.

585
00:20:57,980 --> 00:20:59,880
前提是你们有钱来
You know, if you can afford it.
